      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/f/b38774/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2019-10-07T20:07:11.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Thank you for weighing in on this, Paul, your analysis, and your pro-living wage stance.</p>\n<p>People have to do what they feel is right, but I suggest listening to what the workers forming the union need and ask for. At this time they are specifically not calling for a boycott. That may change but for now folks might want to ease up on the 'down with Kickstarter' rhetoric. If you want to follow the workers you can monitor their twitter at&nbsp; https://twitter.com/ksr_united</p>",
